{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 7, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to the Land of the Rising Sun! A journey most grand awaits thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Wonder**\n\nUpon landing at Narita's gate a sight most fair\nThy carriage doth await a journey to share.\nTo Shinjuku's heart thou shalt make thy way\nWhere neon lights do dance and shadows play.\nA hotel chosen well a haven to find\nRest thy weary head and leave cares behind.\nThen wander through the streets a bustling throng\nAnd taste the ramen where flavors belong.\n\n**Day Two: Temples and Tradition in Tokyo**\n\nTo Asakusa's shore we shall now proceed\nWhere Senso-ji temple doth plant a noble seed.\nWith incense smoke and lanterns bright and bold\nA tale of ancient glory shall unfold.\nThen wander through the market stalls so quaint\nAnd sample treats a most delightful taint.\nIn Ueno Park a tranquil space we'll find\nAnd watch the birds and leave worries behind.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Grace**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's verdant scene\nWhere Mount Fuji's peak doth ever gleam.\nA cruise upon the lake a gentle sway\nAs nature's beauty doth brighten the day.\nThrough art museums we shall softly tread\nAnd marvel at the visions in our head.\nA volcanic hot spring a soothing balm\nTo ease thy spirit and keep thee calm.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Charm a Cultural Dream**\n\nBy train we ride to Kyoto's hallowed ground\nWhere ancient temples silently abound.\nTo Fushimi Inari's gates we'll make our quest\nA thousand vermilion torii blessed.\nThen visit Kiyomizu-dera's wooden stage\nA panoramic view to grace each age.\nGion's district where geishas softly glide\nA glimpse of old Japan where secrets hide.\n\n**Day Five: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Embrace**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden hue\nReflecting in the pond a vision true.\nRyoan-ji's garden a space serene\nWhere stone arrangements whisper what has been.\nNijo Castle's halls a royal past\nWhere emperors once ruled and shadows cast.\nA tea ceremony a ritual so fine\nA moment's peace a truly blessed sign.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we shall journey forth with glee\nTo see the deer that roam so wild and free.\nTodai-ji Temple's Buddha grand and bold\nA statue of bronze a story to be told.\nAmongst the gardens peace doth gently reign\nA tranquil respite from worldly pain.\nThen back to Kyoto a city's sweet release\nA final memory a moment's peace.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure a Farewell to Japan**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid this land adieu\nA tapestry of wonders seen anew.\nFrom Narita's gate thy journey takes its flight\nReturning home bathed in Japan's soft light.\nMay memories linger sweet and ever bright\nOf temples gardens and a wondrous sight.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.002059364225715399}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.2874520507466514e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -0.9089620113372803}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.007153730373829603}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.876909077167511}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.3850415050983429}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -1.7881377516459906e-06}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.0012653210433200002}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -0.0001209901092806831}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.43943169713020325}, {"token": "▁A", "logprob": -0.28607916831970215}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.16955196857452393}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.4641260802745819}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.05790688842535019}, {"token": "▁awaits", "logprob": -0.07447922229766846}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.03525518998503685}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.08505850285291672}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.27253100275993347}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0030251238495111465}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.24761097133159637}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.867